{%- assign sid = section.id -%}

{%- style -%}
#nx-usage-{{ sid }} {
  max-width: var(--container-width-narrow);
  margin: 0 auto;
  padding: 8px 16px;
  font-family: var(--font-body-family, sans-serif);
  color: var(--color-text-main, #111827);
  line-height: 1.7;
  content-visibility: auto;
}
#nx-usage-{{ sid }} h2 {
  font-family: var(--font-heading-family, sans-serif);
  font-size: clamp(22px, 3vw, 30px);
  font-weight: 700;
  line-height: 1.2;
  margin: 0 0 12px;
}
#nx-usage-{{ sid }} ul { padding-left: 18px; margin: 0; }
#nx-usage-{{ sid }} li {
  margin: 8px 0;
  color: var(--color-text-muted, #4b5563);
}
#nx-usage-{{ sid }} li strong { color: var(--color-text-main, #111827); }
{%- endstyle -%}

<section id="nx-usage-{{ sid }}" aria-label="Usage and cycling guidance">
  <h2>Label Precedence &amp; Cycling Limits</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Use the current label:</strong> this guide does not provide a dose, food instruction, timing plan, or route of use.</li>
    <li><strong>No universal cycle:</strong> tolerance and discontinuation risk are compound- and exposure-specific; do not copy a schedule from another product.</li>
    <li><strong>No prescribed pairing:</strong> a reported choline practice does not prove another product is needed.</li>
    <li><strong>Escalate concerns:</strong> reduced effect, increasing use, difficulty stopping, or persistent adverse effects require qualified professional advice.</li>
  </ul>
</section>

{% schema %}
{ "name": "NX — Usage & Cycling", "settings": [], "presets": [{ "name": "NX — Usage & Cycling" }] }
{% endschema %}
